# Used for builds with stack/job/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Paths are relative to the build context stack/job. Only what the build stage
# compiles, plus the component lists the runtime stage copies (COMPONENTS_SRC);
# tests/, target/ and the other files in stack/job stay out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!components*.toml
